{"id":"c03310f48330ea53","group":"58","path":"58/batch09/58-df-circle-method.md","title":"Circle Method","display":"df-circle-method — Circle Method","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-circle-method","aliases":["58-df-circle-method"],"display":"df-circle-method — Circle Method","depends_on":["[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-circle-method"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-circle-method</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-circle-method — Circle Method"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N,Q,r,d\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\">\\(N,Q,r,d\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\delta\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\">\\(\\delta\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}(S,[0,1],\\mathbb C)\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}(S,[0,1],\\mathbb C)\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\in\\mathbb C\">\\(R\\in\\mathbb C\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\\subseteq[0,1]\">\\(M\\subseteq[0,1]\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CircleMethodData}_S\\subseteq V^8\">\\(\\mathrm{CircleMethodData}_S\\subseteq V^8\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}circle\\text{-}method}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{CircleMethodData}_S(N,Q,r,d,\\delta,S,R,M)\\leftrightarrow\nN,Q,r,d\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\land\\delta\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\land\\mathrm{Function}(S,[0,1],\\mathbb C)\\land{}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad \\forall\\alpha\\in[0,1]\\;\\left(S(\\alpha)=\\sum_{1\\leq n\\leq N}e^{2\\pi i\\alpha n^d}\\right)\\land\nR=\\int_0^1S(\\alpha)^r e^{-2\\pi iN\\alpha}\\,d\\alpha\\land{}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad M=[0,1]\\cap\\bigcup_{1\\leq q\\leq Q}\\;\\bigcup_{\\substack{0\\leq a&lt;q\\\\\\gcd(a,q)=1}}\n\\left[\\frac aq-\\delta,\\frac aq+\\delta\\right].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}circle\\text{-}method}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{CircleMethodData}_S(N,Q,r,d,\\delta,S,R,M)\\leftrightarrow\nN,Q,r,d\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\land\\delta\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\land\\mathrm{Function}(S,[0,1],\\mathbb C)\\land{}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad \\forall\\alpha\\in[0,1]\\;\\left(S(\\alpha)=\\sum_{1\\leq n\\leq N}e^{2\\pi i\\alpha n^d}\\right)\\land\nR=\\int_0^1S(\\alpha)^r e^{-2\\pi iN\\alpha}\\,d\\alpha\\land{}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad M=[0,1]\\cap\\bigcup_{1\\leq q\\leq Q}\\;\\bigcup_{\\substack{0\\leq a&lt;q\\\\\\gcd(a,q)=1}}\n\\left[\\frac aq-\\delta,\\frac aq+\\delta\\right].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Hardy–Littlewood circle method separates major and minor arcs.</li>\n<li>Singular integral on major arcs: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\int_{2a/q}^{2b/q} e^{2\\pi i (\\beta N + \\gamma)t^2} dt\">\\(\\int_{2a/q}^{2b/q} e^{2\\pi i (\\beta N + \\gamma)t^2} dt\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>The singular series is assembled from the rational approximations on the major arcs; the minor arcs are estimated as an error term.</li>\n<li>Waring's problem: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g(k)\">\\(g(k)\\)</span> the least <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\">\\(s\\)</span> so every <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N\">\\(N\\)</span> is sum of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\">\\(s\\)</span> <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span>-th powers.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}(S,[0,1],\\mathbb C)$ (see [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"N,Q,r,d\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}","display":false},{"tex":"\\delta\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}(S,[0,1],\\mathbb C)","display":false},{"tex":"R\\in\\mathbb C","display":false},{"tex":"M\\subseteq[0,1]","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CircleMethodData}_S\\subseteq V^8","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}circle\\text{-}method}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{CircleMethodData}_S(N,Q,r,d,\\delta,S,R,M)\\leftrightarrow\nN,Q,r,d\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}\\land\\delta\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\land\\mathrm{Function}(S,[0,1],\\mathbb C)\\land{}\\\\\n&\\quad \\forall\\alpha\\in[0,1]\\;\\left(S(\\alpha)=\\sum_{1\\leq n\\leq N}e^{2\\pi i\\alpha n^d}\\right)\\land\nR=\\int_0^1S(\\alpha)^r e^{-2\\pi iN\\alpha}\\,d\\alpha\\land{}\\\\\n&\\quad M=[0,1]\\cap\\bigcup_{1\\leq q\\leq Q}\\;\\bigcup_{\\substack{0\\leq a<q\\\\\\gcd(a,q)=1}}\n\\left[\\frac aq-\\delta,\\frac aq+\\delta\\right].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\int_{2a/q}^{2b/q} e^{2\\pi i (\\beta N + \\gamma)t^2} dt","display":false},{"tex":"g(k)","display":false},{"tex":"s","display":false},{"tex":"N","display":false},{"tex":"s","display":false},{"tex":"k","display":false}],"bytes":1469,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-278","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-circle-method.md|58-df-circle-method]]（batch09）"}],"outgoing":["36d7463d215be751"]}